# Root .easignore REPLACES .gitignore for EAS uploads — keep exclusions complete.
# Mobile EAS runs from user-business-mobile/MobileApp but packs from git root.

# Sibling / unrelated projects (major bloat — aux-amd-serving alone ~128MB)
aux-amd-serving/**
user-business-web/**
discovery-ingestion/**
DesignSystem/**
future-plans/**
scripts/**
.cursor/**
.vscode/**

# Reference / docs (not part of the app bundle)
user-business-mobile/reference apps/**
user-business-web/reference apps/**
*.md
!user-business-mobile/MobileApp/docs/README.md

# Never upload local native folders — EAS must prebuild on Linux
user-business-mobile/MobileApp/android/**
user-business-mobile/MobileApp/ios/**

# Never upload local deps or native build caches (EAS runs npm ci)
**/node_modules/**
**/.cxx/**
**/android/build/**
**/android/.gradle/**

# Expo / agent local artifacts
**/.expo/**
**/.expo-tmp-check/**
**/logs/**
**/.local/**

# Local secrets (use EAS env / file secrets instead)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist

# Misc from .gitignore
*.orig.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
.DS_Store
*.pem
*.tsbuildinfo
.metro-health-check*
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
todo.md
